    "updated_at": "2025-11-06T07:03:07Z",
    "body": "If we are going to have many of these some IDL support could be nice I suppose so specifications can have `[ToJSON] any` and the specification algorithm will then get passed a byte sequence (or possibly a string). That will also ensure everyone does the exact same thing.",
